 ```
 
+Remove items from the front in FIFO order with `drain()`. Omit the count to remove everything, or provide a finite nonnegative integer to remove up to that many items:
+
+```js
+const denque = new Denque([1,2,3,4]);
+denque.drain(2); // [1, 2]
+denque.toArray(); // [3, 4]
+```
+
 
 See the [API reference documentation](https://docs.page/invertase/denque/api) for more examples.
 
